TY  - GEN
ID  - kmj-48-2-255
AU  - Takata, Toshie
TI  - A Formula for the Colored Jones Polynomial of 2-Bridge Knots
DA  - D:20080422
AB  - We derive a formula for the colored Jones polynomial of 2-bridge knots. For a twist knot, a more explicit formula is given and it leads to a relation between the degree of the colored Jones polynomial and the crossing number.
ER  - 
